            "thm-heine-borel-rn"
          ],
          "statement": "For every open set $\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n$, the space $C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$ is dense in $C_0(\\Omega)$ in the uniform norm.",
          "sources": {
