          "justified_by": [],
          "statement": "Let $n\\ge1$, let $L$ be a free abelian group of rank $n$ with an integer-valued symmetric bilinear form whose Gram determinant is $1$ or $-1$, and let $f:L\\to\\mathbb Z^n$ be an isometric homomorphism, where $\\mathbb Z^n$ has its standard dot product. Then $f(L)=\\mathbb Z^n$.",
