          "statement": "Assume full AC. Let $X$ be a closed connected oriented smooth Riemannian four-manifold, let $b_1(X)=\\dim H^1(X;\\mathbb R)$, let $b_-(X)$ be the dimension of the negative subspace of its real intersection form, and let $P\\to X$ be a smooth principal $SU(2)$-bundle. Put $k=-\\langle c_2(P),[X]\\rangle$. For the real Fredholm operator $D_A=d_A^*\\oplus d_A^-$ from first Sobolev one-forms with values in $\\operatorname{ad}P$ to zeroth Sobolev zero-forms and anti-self-dual two-forms, its Fredholm index is $8k-3(1-b_1(X)+b_-(X))$. In particular, if $\\pi_1(X)=0$, the intersection form is positive definite, and $c_2(P)[X]=-1$, then $\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathbb R}(D_A)=5$.",
