h with a supplied basis of contractible open neighborhoods, if $f_*(N)\\subseteq N'\\triangleleft\\pi_1(W',o')$, these identifications commute with the induced homology maps and quotient-group coefficient maps. This includes every connected Hausdorff manifold, with boundary allowed, and every connected finite polyhedron. No finite CW structure, compactness, finite generation of $\\pi$, or choice principle is assumed.",
