          "statement": "Assume countable choice. Let $\\mathcal C$ be a ribbon category with chosen left duals. If two finite colored braids have color-preserving endpoint permutations and their blackboard-framed closures are isotopic as oriented framed links by an isotopy preserving each component color, then their evaluations agree in $\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf1)$. Thus the framed colored evaluation of a closed braid is independent of its colored-braid representative whenever the represented framed colored links are the same.",
