ial x=\\sum_y c_{xy}U^{(M(y)-M(x)+1)/2}y$, define $\\partial_t x=\\sum_y c_{xy}v^{\\operatorname{gr}_t(y)-\\operatorname{gr}_t(x)+1}y$. This differential lowers $t$-grading by one. The comparison between its non-torsion tower grading and the finite cycle minimum is the separate filtered tower-splitting claim."
