          ],
          "dependency_level": 1,
          "statement": "Let $M$ be a smooth oriented $3$-manifold, and put\n$R=\\mathbb Z[A^{\\pm1}]$ and $\\delta=-A^2-A^{-2}$. A **framed unoriented\nlink in $M$** is a finite disjoint union of smoothly embedded annuli\n$S^1\\times[-1,1]$ in the interior of $M$, considered up to ambient isotopy\nthrough such framed annuli; the empty union is allowed. Let\n$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{fr}}(M)$ be the set of these isotopy classes and let\n$\\mathcal F_R(M)$ be the free $R$-module with basis\n$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{fr}}(M)$.\n\nFor the local crossing relation, choose an orientation-preserving chart from a\nclosed $3$-ball in $M$ to a standard ball in $\\mathbb R^3$, and project to the\nfirst two coordinates. In the displayed chart the over-strand runs from the\nsouthwest endpoint to the northeast endpoint, and the under-strand runs from\nthe northwest endpoint to the southeast endpoint. The $A$-smoothing pairs the\ntwo left endpoints and the two right endpoints, and the $B$-smoothing pairs\nthe two top endpoints and the two bottom endpoints. All three local tangles,\nincluding the crossing strands, carry the blackboard framing of the displayed\nprojection, with no additional framing twists. Their framed strips coincide\nin a collar of the four endpoints.\n\n```tikz\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62,line cap=round,line join=round]\n  \\begin{scope}\n    \\draw[thick] (-1,1)--(-0.14,0.14);\n    \\draw[thick] (0.14,-0.14)--(1,-1);\n    \\draw[very thick] (-1,-1)--(1,1);\n    \\node at (0,-1.38) {crossing};\n  \\end{scope}\n  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.0cm]\n    \\draw[thick] (-1,1) .. controls (-0.45,0.35) and (-0.45,-0.35) .. (-1,-1);\n    \\draw[thick] (1,1) .. controls (0.45,0.35) and (0.45,-0.35) .. (1,-1);\n    \\node at (0,-1.38) {$A$-smoothing, weight $A$};\n  \\end{scope}\n  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.0cm]\n    \\draw[thick] (-1,1) .. controls (-0.35,0.45) and (0.35,0.45) .. (1,1);\n    \\draw[thick] (-1,-1) .. controls (-0.35,-0.45) and (0.35,-0.45) .. (1,-1);\n    \\node at (0,-1.38) {$B$-smoothing, weight $A^{-1}$};\n  \\end{scope}\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n```\n\nFor each such local triple, the three framed links agree outside the chart.\nLet $\\mathcal R_A(M)$ be the submodule of $\\mathcal F_R(M)$ generated by\n$[L_\\times]-A[L_A]-A^{-1}[L_B]$ for all crossing triples, and by\n$[L\\sqcup O]-\\delta[L]$ for every framed link $L$, where $O$ is a\nzero-framed trivial circle bounding a disk in a ball disjoint from $L$. The\n**Kauffman bracket skein module** of $M$ is\n$$\n\\mathcal K_A(M):=\\mathcal F_R(M)/\\mathcal R_A(M).\n$$\nThe relations are imposed on framed link classes; no unframed type-I\nidentification is added.",
