          "dependency_level": 3,
          "statement": "Assume full AC. For a based smooth knot $K\\subset S^3$ with the earring and admissible singular-bundle data above, let $C^\\natural(K;\\mathbb Z)$ be the integral singular-instanton cochain complex: its generators are regular critical points of the perturbed Chern–Simons functional on the corresponding singular configuration space, and its degree-one differential counts oriented zero-dimensional moduli spaces of trajectories for the perturbed singular anti-self-dual equation. Here finite energy is the flow energy $2\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\|\\partial_tB\\|_2^2dt$ in temporal gauge, equivalently the perturbed topological energy of the relative trajectory class, rather than unrenormalized curvature energy over the infinite cylinder. The grading is relative modulo four, and the differential has degree one. Define $I^\\natural(K;\\mathbb Z):=H^*(C^\\natural(K;\\mathbb Z))$ using the analytic construction and independence of choices established in Analytic foundations for the singular instanton knot complex. Write $I^\\natural(K;\\mathbb Q):=I^\\natural(K;\\mathbb Z)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Q$. The invariant class specified here is the isomorphism class of this group with its relative grading; the continuation identifications retain the declared overall sign ambiguity.",
